      "writtenOn": "2018-08-07T14:10:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When ponsim ONU/OLT is started there are a number of parameters that are passed to it via the yml file.   A new argument can be added to include a serial number.   The serial number can then be added to the ponsim proto (ponsimdeviceinfo).   Then, in the adapter (olt and onu) the serial number can be obtained directly from the ponsim device instead of hardcoding it.   Any one starting ponsim can change the serial number to the one they have configured in the north bound controller.  Also, the serial number must follow the common serial number format.",
      "parentUuid": "1bd79293_23510dd2",
